*.ndjson

# ...except the recorded corpora promoted to committed test fixtures. D3's
# event type is designed against these (ADR 0003) and phase 1's corpus-replay
# adapter reads them, so they have to survive a fresh checkout. 128K total.
!test/corpus/*.ndjson

